  "hasanatDurationYearsMonthsShort": "{years} yr {months}m",
  "@hasanatDurationYearsMonthsShort": {
    "description": "A giving period of some years plus some leftover months on the recurring tab of the rewards calculator, e.g. '5 yr 7m'. 'yr' and 'm' are deliberate abbreviations of 'years' and 'months' — abbreviate in the target language too, since this must stay on one line in a narrow space. Only used when the number of months is not an exact multiple of twelve.",
